<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-12T13:00:27.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:00:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities detained 14 suspected Sinaloa cartel members in Chiapas, including two regional leaders, while a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7‑year-old American girl. In the United States, an ICE officer in Maine who held anti-immigrant views was involved in a fatal shooting of an immigrant, and the same officer had a troubling history revealed by investigations. A Los Angeles gang member and a cartel boss were indicted for helping fugitive Ryan Wedding evade capture after the cartel boss provided fake police identification. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPSDJMU3FZUEdVZEgyazB0MU9pbndQZDVHS0RBUG5sUE5lRk53SVVhM3lzREFodG9KS2oyZVcxWHZFdHU0UmVHWGxFM0tOS3pIUEU3S2laXzdRMjhPLWJKYzZLUjZCUDVQNG5YRHl1YUVMWkJjOUY2OGhuVlFrbk55UER6RGxjcjFSRGpN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQdS1GbzltMHFZb0VRZ3dOSVdsWS1IY3cwVkJOd0lrTUVSOTZxRy16bHFqSFFQa1IxUlU0RjhtZlk3RlJqU2JSVVpxZHh1NGVXS2FVbDNCTEFDWnp1VGxFUlJLNGJyVlpmU3VnRDF5TXZBYlkyWDdIV0pjSjNZMktlLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3374243/trump-threatens-double-tariffs-mexico-if-it-does-not-halt-migrants&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;myMotherLode.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPYkxXaDZZeEwtWlhsQkUtSTdrS2RVSGNuamNoYVNZZ0psdHpBU2N6U1dWaVkzdnpkbFktRWtCVDhJMjA1eDRBMHR3NHAzQTZha05CV256M2pEWmktUkk3UEpGemxld0lvdkVTWjNOMkViN2tvZ0R